#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:81
msgid ""
"The pressure reported by the tablet, between 0.0 and 1.0. If you use the "
"mouse, it will be 0.5 when a button is pressed and 0.0 otherwise."
msgstr ""
"De Andruck, den dat Tablett torüchmeldt. - En Weert twischen 0,0 un 1,0. Bi "
"Muusbruuk is de Weert mit drückt Muusknoop 0,5 un anners 0,0."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:82
msgid ""
"How fast you currently move. This can change very quickly. Try 'print input "
"values' from the 'help' menu to get a feeling for the range; negative values "
"are rare but possible for very low speed."
msgstr ""
"Dien aktuell Treckgauheit. De kann sik bannig gau ännern. Dat Rebeet lett "
"sik över de Utgaav vun Ingaavweerten in't Hülp-Menü utkieken. Negativ "
"Weerten warrt nich so faken bruukt, man sünd för bannig siete Gauheit ok "
"mööglich."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Same as speed1, but changes slower. Also look at the 'speed2 filter' setting."
msgstr ""
"Dat sülve as »Gauheit 1«, man mit langsamer Ännern. Kiek Di ok de Instellen "
"för »Gauheitfilter 2« an."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Fast random noise, changing at each evaluation. Evenly distributed between 0 "
"and 1."
msgstr ""
"Gau tofällig Rusen, dat sik bi elk Utweerten ännert. Egaalweg verdeelt "
"twischen 0 un 1."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:85
msgid ""
"This input slowly goes from zero to one while you draw a stroke. It can also "
"be configured to jump back to zero periodically while you move. Look at the "
"'stroke duration' and 'stroke hold time' settings."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ingaav ännert sik bi't Teken vun en Streek suutje vun 0 bet na 1. Een "
"kann ok instellen, dat se bi't Teken in fastleggt Afstänn wedder op 0 "
"torüchjumpt. Kiek Di de Instellen för Streekduer un Streek-Holltiet an."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:86
msgid ""
"The angle of the stroke, in degrees. The value will stay between 0.0 and "
"180.0, effectively ignoring turns of 180 degrees."
msgstr ""
"De Streekwinkel, angeven in Graad. De Weert blifft twischen 0 un 180, d.h., "
"dat Dreihen vun 180 Graad övergahn warrt."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:87
msgid ""
"This is a user defined input. Look at the 'custom input' setting for details."
msgstr ""
"Dit is een vun den Bruker fastleggt Ingaav. Kiek Di de Instellen för »Egen "
"Ingaav« a, wenn Du mehr Enkelheiten weten wullt."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:152
msgid "opaque"
msgstr "Decken"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:152
msgid ""
"0 means brush is transparent, 1 fully visible\n"
"(also known as alpha or opacity)"
msgstr ""
"»0« bedüüdt, de Pinsel is dörsichtig, un »1«, he is heel sichtbor\n"
"(ok as Alpha oder Deckstärk begäng)."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:153
msgid "opaque multiply"
msgstr "Decken maalnehmen"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:153
msgid ""
"This gets multiplied with opaque. It is used for making opaque depend on "
"pressure (or other inputs)."
msgstr ""
"Dit warrt mit de Deckstärk maalnahmen. Warrt för druckafhangen Decken (oder "
"anner Ingaven) bruukt."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:154
msgid "opaque linearize"
msgstr "Decken lineariseren"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:154
msgid ""
"Correct the nonlinearity introduced by blending multiple dabs on top of each "
"other. This correction should get you a linear (\"natural\") pressure "
"response when pressure is mapped to opaque_multiply, as it is usually done. "
"0.9 is good for standard strokes, set it smaller if your brush scatters a "
"lot, or higher if you use dabs_per_second.\n"
"0.0 the opaque value above is for the individual dabs\n"
"1.0 the opaque value above is for the final brush stroke, assuming each "
"pixel gets (dabs_per_radius*2) brushdabs on average during a stroke"
msgstr ""
"De Nich-Lineariteet richten, de bi't Överblennen vun mehr Plackens "
"övereenanner rinkaamt. Dit Richten schall en lineaar »normaal« Druck "
"torüchgeven, wenn den Druck »opaque_multiply« toornt is, wat de "
"Normaalinstellen is. De Weert »0,9« lett sik goot för Standardstreken bruken. "
"Maak dit lütter, wenn Dien Pinsel bannig streut, oder grötter, wenn Du "
"»Plackens per Sekunn« bruukst.\n"
"0.0 - de Deckweert baven is för Dien egen Plackens\n"
"1.0 - de Deckweert baven is för den lesten Pinselstreek. Annahmen warrt, dat "
"elk Pixel in'n Dörsnitt (dabs_per_radius*2) Pinselplackens per Streek kriggt."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:155
msgid ""
"basic brush radius (logarithmic)\n"
" 0.7 means 2 pixels\n"
" 3.0 means 20 pixels"
msgstr ""
"Grundhalfmaat vun den Pinsel (logaritmisch)\n"
" 0.7 bedüüdt 2 Pixels\n"
" 3.0 bedüüdt 20 Pixels"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:156
msgid "hardness"
msgstr "Scharpde"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:156
msgid "hard brush-circle borders (setting to zero will draw nothing)"
msgstr "Scharp afsett Pinselkrinkgrenzen (Instellen »0« teekt Nix)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:157
msgid "dabs per basic radius"
msgstr "Plackens per Grundhalfmaat"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:157
msgid ""
"how many dabs to draw while the pointer moves a distance of one brush radius "
"(more precise: the base value of the radius)"
msgstr ""
"Woveel Plackens bi en Wieserbewegen vun den Afstand vun een Pinselhalfmaat "
"teekt warrt (nauer: de Grundweert för dat Halfmaat)."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:158
msgid "dabs per actual radius"
msgstr "Plackens per redig Halfmaat:"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:158
msgid ""
"same as above, but the radius actually drawn is used, which can change "
"dynamically"
msgstr ""
"Dat sülve as baven, man bruukt dat redig teekt Halfmaat, dat sik dünaamsch "
"ännern kann."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:159
msgid "dabs per second"
msgstr "Plackens per Sekunn"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:159
msgid "dabs to draw each second, no matter how far the pointer moves"
msgstr ""
"De Tall vun Plackens, de elk Sekunn teekt warrt, egaal wo wiet de Wieser "
"treckt warrt."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:160
msgid "radius by random"
msgstr "Tofällig Halfmaat"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:160
msgid ""
"Alter the radius randomly each dab. You can also do this with the by_random "
"input on the radius setting. If you do it here, there are two differences:\n"
"1) the opaque value will be corrected such that a big-radius dabs is more "
"transparent\n"
"2) it will not change the actual radius seen by dabs_per_actual_radius"
msgstr ""
"Tofällig Halfmaatännern för elk Placken. Ok mit de Ingaav »by_random« bi de "
"Halfmaatinstellen instellbor. Wenn dat hier instellt warrt, gifft dat twee "
"Verschelen:\n"
"1.) De Weert för de Deckstärk warrt richt, so dat en groot Placken "
"dörsichtiger is.\n"
"2.) Dat bi »dabs_per_actual_radius« sehn redig Halfmaat warrt nich ännert."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:161
msgid "speed1 filter"
msgstr "Gauheitfilter 1"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:161
msgid ""
"how slowly the input speed1 follows the real speed.\n"
"0.0 changes immediately as your speed changes (not recommended, but try it.)"
msgstr ""
"Wo siet de eerste Ingaavgauheit is, afhangen vun de redige Gauheit.\n"
"0,0 ännert direktemang, so as sik Dien Gauheit ännert (nich anraadt, man "
"versöök dat maal)."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:162
msgid "speed2 filter"
msgstr "Gauheitfilter 2"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:162
msgid "same as 'speed1 slowness' but note that the range is different"
msgstr "Dat sülve as »Gauheitfilter 1«, man mit en anner Rebeet"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:163
msgid "speed1 gamma"
msgstr "Gamma för Gauheit 1"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:163
msgid ""
"This changes the reaction of the speed1 input to extreme physical speed. You "
"will see the difference best if speed1 is mapped to the radius.\n"
"-8.0 very fast speed does not increase speed1 much more\n"
"+8.0 very fast speed increases speed1 a lot\n"
"For very slow speed the opposite happens."
msgstr ""
"Dit ännert de Reakschoon vun de Ingaav »Gauheit 1« hen to övermaten "
"physikaalsch Gauheit. Dat fallt sünnerlich op, wenn »Gauheit 1« dat Halfmaat "
"toornt is.\n"
"-8.0 - bannig gau, maakt »Gauheit 1« meist nich mehr grötter\n"
"+8.0 - bannig gau, maakt »Gauheit 1« bannig grötter\n"
"Bi bannig siete Gauheit is dat annersrüm."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:164
msgid "speed2 gamma"
msgstr "Gamma för Gauheit 2"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:164
msgid "same as 'speed1 gamma' for speed2"
msgstr "Dat sülve as »Gauheit 1«, man för »Gauheit 2«"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:165
msgid "jitter"
msgstr "Jiddeln"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:165
msgid ""
"add a random offset to the position where each dab is drawn\n"
" 0.0 disabled\n"
" 1.0 standard deviation is one basic radius away\n"
"<0.0 negative values produce no jitter"
msgstr ""
"Tofällig Versatz twischen de Plackenpositschonen tofögen.\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - Standardverscheel is een Grundhalfmaat wiet weg\n"
"<0.0 - negativ Weerten lööst keen Jiddeln ut"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:166
msgid "offset by speed"
msgstr "Versatz na Gauheit"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:166
msgid ""
"change position depending on pointer speed\n"
"= 0 disable\n"
"> 0 draw where the pointer moves to\n"
"< 0 draw where the pointer comes from"
msgstr ""
"Vun de Muuswiesergauheit afhangen Positschoonännern\n"
"= 0 - ut\n"
"> 0 - dorhen malen, wo de Muuswieser hengeiht\n"
"< 0 - dorhen malen, wo de Muuswieser herkummt"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:167
msgid "offset by speed filter"
msgstr "Versatz na Gauheit-Filter"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:167
msgid "how slow the offset goes back to zero when the cursor stops moving"
msgstr "Wo langsam de Versatz ahn Wieserbewegen wedder op Null torüchgeiht"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:168
msgid "slow position tracking"
msgstr "Muuspositschoon langsam nagahn"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:168
msgid ""
"Slowdown pointer tracking speed. 0 disables it, higher values remove more "
"jitter in cursor movements. Useful for drawing smooth, comic-like outlines."
msgstr ""
"De Wiesertreck-Gauheit minnern. »0« maakt dit ut, höger Weerten deit mehr "
"Jiddeln ut de Wieserbewegen weg. Dat is goot för week, comic-lieke Ümreten."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:169
msgid "slow tracking per dab"
msgstr "Plackens langsam nagahn"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:169
msgid ""
"Similar as above but at brushdab level (ignoring how much time has past, if "
"brushdabs do not depend on time)"
msgstr ""
"Dat sülve as baven, man för Pinselplackens (egaal, woveel Tiet vörbi is, "
"wenn Pinselplackens nich vun de Tiet afhangt.)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:170
msgid "tracking noise"
msgstr "Treckrusen"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:170
msgid ""
"add randomness to the mouse pointer; this usually generates many small lines "
"in random directions; maybe try this together with 'slow tracking'"
msgstr ""
"Föögt den Muuswieser »Tofälligkeit« to. Dit stellt normalerwies vele lütte "
"Streken na tofällige Richten op. Versöök dit villicht tohoop mit »Langsam "
"nagahn«."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:172
msgid "color hue"
msgstr "Klöörtoon"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:173
msgid "color saturation"
msgstr "Klöörsattheit"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:174
msgid "color value"
msgstr "Klöörweert"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:174
msgid "color value (brightness, intensity)"
msgstr "Klöörweert (Helligkeit, Stärk)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:175
msgid "change color hue"
msgstr "Klöörtoon ännern"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:175
msgid ""
"Change color hue.\n"
"-0.1 small clockwise color hue shift\n"
" 0.0 disable\n"
" 0.5 counterclockwise hue shift by 180 degrees"
msgstr ""
"Klöörtoon ännern.\n"
"-0.1 - lütt Klöörtoonverschuven in Klockricht\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 0.5 - Klöörtoonverschuven üm 180 Graad gegen de Klockricht"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:176
msgid "change color lightness (HSL)"
msgstr "Klöörhelligkeit ännern (TSH)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:176
msgid ""
"Change the color lightness (luminance) using the HSL color model.\n"
"-1.0 blacker\n"
" 0.0 disable\n"
" 1.0 whiter"
msgstr ""
"De Klöörhelligkeit (Lüchtdicht) mit dat TSH-Klöörmodell ännern.\n"
"-1.0 - swatter\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - witter"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:177
msgid "change color satur. (HSL)"
msgstr "Klöörsattheit ännern (TSH)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:177
msgid ""
"Change the color saturation using the HSL color model.\n"
"-1.0 more grayish\n"
" 0.0 disable\n"
" 1.0 more saturated"
msgstr ""
"Klöörsattheit mit dat TSH-Klöörmodell ännern.\n"
"-1.0 - keesiger\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - satter"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:178
msgid "change color value (HSV)"
msgstr "Klöörweert ännern (TSW)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:178
msgid ""
"Change the color value (brightness, intensity) using the HSV color model. "
"HSV changes are applied before HSL.\n"
"-1.0 darker\n"
" 0.0 disable\n"
" 1.0 brigher"
msgstr ""
"Klöörweert (Helligkeit, Stärk) mit dat TSW-Klörenmodell ännern. TSW-Ännern "
"warrt vör TSH anwendt.\n"
"-1.0 - düüsterer\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - heller"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:179
msgid "change color satur. (HSV)"
msgstr "Klöörsattheit ännern (TSW)"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:179
msgid ""
"Change the color saturation using the HSV color model. HSV changes are "
"applied before HSL.\n"
"-1.0 more grayish\n"
" 0.0 disable\n"
" 1.0 more saturated"
msgstr ""
"Klöörsattheit mit dat TSW-Klöörmodell ännern. TSW-Ännern warrt vör TSH "
"anwendt.\n"
"-1.0 - keesiger\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - satter"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:180
msgid "smudge"
msgstr "Verwischen"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:180
msgid ""
"Paint with the smudge color instead of the brush color. The smudge color is "
"slowly changed to the color you are painting on.\n"
" 0.0 do not use the smudge color\n"
" 0.5 mix the smudge color with the brush color\n"
" 1.0 use only the smudge color"
msgstr ""
"Mit de Klöör för't Verwischen malen, ansteed mit de Pinselklöör. De "
"Verwischen-Klöör warrt suutje na de aktuelle Maalklöör hen ännert.\n"
" 0.0 - keen Verwischen-Klöör bruken\n"
" 0.5 - Verwischen-Klöör un Maalklöör mischen\n"
" 1.0 - bloots de Verwischen-Klöör bruken"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:181
msgid "smudge length"
msgstr "Verwischenduer"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:181
msgid ""
"This controls how fast the smudge color becomes the color you are painting "
"on.\n"
"0.0 immediately change the smudge color\n"
"1.0 never change the smudge color"
msgstr ""
"Dit leggt fast, wo gau de Verwischenklöör na de aktuelle Maalklöör ännert "
"warrt.\n"
"0.0 - Verwischenklöör direktemang ännern\n"
"1.0 - Verwischenklöör nienich ännern"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:182
msgid "eraser"
msgstr "Radeergummi"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:182
msgid ""
"how much this tool behaves like an eraser\n"
" 0.0 normal painting\n"
" 1.0 standard eraser\n"
" 0.5 pixels go towards 50% transparency"
msgstr ""
"Wo dannig utradeert warrt\n"
" 0.0 - normaal Maalbedrief\n"
" 1.0 - Standard-Radeergummi\n"
" 0.5 - Pixels warrt so wat 50% dörsichtiger"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:184
msgid "stroke threshold"
msgstr "Streeksüll"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:184
msgid ""
"How much pressure is needed to start a stroke. This affects the stroke input "
"only. Mypaint does not need a minimal pressure to start drawing."
msgstr ""
"Wo fast Een för en Streek drücken mutt. Dit gellt bloots för de "
"Streekingaav. »Mypaint« bruukt keen Minndruck för't Malen."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:185
msgid "stroke duration"
msgstr "Streekduer"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:185
msgid ""
"How far you have to move until the stroke input reaches 1.0. This value is "
"logarithmic (negative values will not invert the process)."
msgstr ""
"Wo wiet Een trecken mutt, bet de Streekingaav bi 1,0 anlangt. Disse Weert is "
"logaritmisch (negativ Weerten dreiht den Perzess nich üm)."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:186
msgid "stroke hold time"
msgstr "Streek-Holltiet"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:186
msgid ""
"This defines how long the stroke input stays at 1.0. After that it will "
"reset to 0.0 and start growing again, even if the stroke is not yet "
"finished.\n"
"2.0 means twice as long as it takes to go from 0.0 to 1.0\n"
"9.9 and bigger stands for infinite"
msgstr ""
"Fastleggen, wo lang de Streekingaav op 1.0 blifft. Dorna warrt se op 0.0 "
"torüchsett un wasst wedder an, ok wenn de Streek noch nich fardig is.\n"
"2.0 bedüüdt dubbelt so lang as dat vun 0.0 bet 1.0 duert.\n"
"9.9 un mehr bedüüdt »ahn Enn«."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:187
msgid "custom input"
msgstr "Egen Ingaav"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:187
msgid ""
"Set the custom input to this value. If it is slowed down, move it towards "
"this value (see below). The idea is that you make this input depend on a "
"mixture of pressure/speed/whatever, and then make other this depend on this "
"'custom input' instead of repeating this combination everywhere you need "
"it.\n"
"If you make it change 'by random' you can generate a slow (smooth) random "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Sett de egen Ingaav op dissen Weert. Warrt se to langsam, verschuuv ehr mehr "
"na dissen Weert hen (kiek nerrn). Dit is dorför dacht, dat disse Ingaav vun "
"en Mischen ut Druck/Gauheit/Watjümmers afhangt, un denn wedder annerswat vun "
"even disse »egen Ingaav« afhangt, dormit Een disse Kombinatschoon nich för "
"elk Bruuk nieg opstellen mutt.\n"
"Is instellt, dat sik de Ingaav »tofällig« ännert, denn warrt se suutje (week) "
"un tofällig."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:188
msgid "custom input filter"
msgstr "Egen Ingaavfilter"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:188
msgid ""
"How slow the custom input actually follows the desired value (the one "
"above). This happens at brushdab level (ignoring how much time has past, if "
"brushdabs do not depend on time).\n"
"0.0 no slowdown (changes apply instantly)"
msgstr ""
"Wo suutje de egen Ingaav sik na den instellten Weert (de Weert baven) hen "
"ännert. Dit passeert in de Pinselplackens-Stoop (egaal, woveel Tiet vörbi "
"is, wenn Pinselplackens nich vun de Tiet afhangt).\n"
"0,0 - keen Gauheit-Minnern (Ännern warrt direktemang övernahmen)."

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:190
msgid "elliptical dab: ratio"
msgstr "Elliptsch Placken: Proportschoon"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:190
msgid ""
"aspect ratio of the dabs; must be >= 1.0, where 1.0 means a perfectly round "
"dab. TODO: linearize? start at 0.0 maybe, or log?"
msgstr ""
"Proportschonen för de Plackens; mutt >= 1.0 wesen. 1.0 is en akraat rund "
"Placken. TO DOON: Lineariseren? Villicht bi 0.0 starten, oder loggen?"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:191
msgid "elliptical dab: angle"
msgstr "Elliptsch Placken: Winkel"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:191
msgid ""
"this defines the angle by which eliptical dabs are tilted\n"
" 0.0 horizontal dabs\n"
" 45.0 45 degrees, turned clockwise\n"
" 180.0 horizontal again"
msgstr ""
"Den Winkel fastleggen, üm den elliptsch Plackens dreiht warrt.\n"
" 0,0 - kimmrecht Plackens\n"
" 45,0 - 45 Graad, in Klockricht dreihen 180,0 - wedder kimmrecht"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:192
msgid "direction filter"
msgstr "Richtfilter"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:192
msgid ""
"a low value will make the direction input adapt more quickly, a high value "
"will make it smoother"
msgstr ""
"En siet Weert maakt de Topassen för de Richtingaav gauer, höger Weerten "
"maakt ehr weeker."

